// Supabase client config (baked into Info.plist at build time).
// Anon / publishable key is safe to ship in the app when RLS is enabled.
// Never put service_role / sb_secret_… here.
//
// xcconfig treats // as a comment — write https:/$()/host not https://host
//
// Environment-specific values live in Staging.xcconfig and
// Production.xcconfig. Keep this file free of deployment credentials.
